@70 = ~Christopher Lee~
@1 = ~Nothing will stand in our way!~ [IVC03i]
@2 = ~Victory is at hand!~ [IVC03j]
@3 = ~This way!~ [IVC03k]
@4 = ~His gaze pierces cloud, shadow, earth and flesh.~ [IVC03s]
@5 = ~You do not know pain, you do not know fear!~ [IVC03t]
@6 = ~We have only to remove those who oppose us.~ [IVC03u]
@7 = ~There would be no dawn for men.~ [IVC03v]
@8 = ~Do you know how the orcs first came to being? They were elves once.~ [IVC03x]
@9 = ~One ill turn deserves another. It is over.~ [IVC03y]
@10 = ~Stain the land with blood of our enemies!~ [IVC03a]
@11 = ~You have elected the way of pain!~ [IVC038]
@12 = ~You are all going to die!~ [IVC039]
@13 = ~Leave none alive!~ [IVC03g_]
@14 = ~So you have chosen... death!~ [IVC03h_]
@15 = ~Time? What time do you think we have?~ [IVC03d]
@16 = ~What is the house of Rohan but a thatched barn where brigands drink in the reek and rats roll on the floor with the dogs?~ [IVC03o]
@17 = ~We have work to do.~ [IVC03f]
@18 = ~You are sure of this?~ [IVC03g]
@19 = ~The hour grows late.~ [IVC03h]
@20 = ~Whom do you serve?~ [IVC030]
@21 = ~It would be wise, my friend.~ [IVC03k_]
@22 = ~The world is changing.~ [IVC03l_]
@23 = ~As you see my powers are far beyond yours!~ [IVC03z]
@24 = ~Good! Twice the pride, double the fall!~ [IVC031]
@25 = ~~ [IVC03l]
@26 = ~One ring to rule them all, one ring to find them, One ring to bring them all, and in the darkness bind them.~ [IVC03q]
@27 = ~Surely you can do better!~ [IVC036]
@28 = ~Something fester in heart of Middle-Earth. Something that you have failed to see.~ [IVC03p]
@29 = ~Save your pity and your mercy I have no use for it!~ [IVC03m]
@30 = ~The old world will burn in the fires of industry. Forrest will fall. New order will rise.~ [IVC03n]
@31 = ~I'm sure you did the best you could. We will discuss your failure later.~ [IVC03w]
@32 = ~Brave, but foolish!~ [IVC03e]
@33 = ~Does he seek to humble me with his new found piety!~ [IVC032]
@34 = ~Your love of the halfling's leaf has clearly slowed your mind.~ [IVC033]
@35 = ~New power is rising! It's victory is at hand!~ [IVC03b]
@36 = ~We will drive the machine of war with the sword and the spear and the iron fist of the orc.~ [IVC03r]
@37 = ~That is why you have come, is it not?~ [IVC034]
@38 = ~Time? What time do you think we have?~ [IVC03w_]
@39 = ~I want them armed and ready to march within two weeks!~ [IVC03x_]
@40 = ~The hour is later then you think.~ [IVC03y_]
@41 = ~Hunt them down! Do not stop until they are found!~ [IVC03z_]
@42 = ~Move on!~ [IVC035]
@43 = ~You've interfered with our affairs for the last time.~ [IVC03c]
@44 = ~Why should we fear to use it?~ [IVC037]
